          "qualifiedTypeId": "game.core.world.motive",
          "value": {
            "status": "active",
            "summary": "Cringeworthy young mast merchant who rehearses nautical metaphors and uses all of them incorrectly. Wants to recover stolen timber and impress the shipwright fraternities; excellent with accounts and tree provenance; easily manipulated by praise. Secretly funds the Dry Admiral's poorest regulars. He matures when his ledger skill, not his performance, saves livelihoods.",
