          "value": {
            "status": "active",
            "summary": "Dramatic romantic caravan guard who dedicates each crossing to a different legendary lost traveler. Wants the saddle theft solved; excellent with animals and mountain pursuit; secretly recognizes one supposed dead survivor. Former rival of Arlen Pott. He reveals the survivor only when convinced the party respects chosen lives.",
