          "value": {
            "status": "active",
            "summary": "Socially awkward spice broker who identifies aromas brilliantly and compliments people as if describing soup. Wants the smoke-tainted cargo cleared; knows trade routes and plant scents; accidentally insults important buyers. Purchases saffron through Namarra. Patient interpretation lets Venn trace the threatened forest without becoming a joke.",
