            "status": "active",
            "summary": "Cheerful petition writer at Pomegranate Court who celebrates correctly completed forms with tiny fanfares. Wants copper contamination addressed before officials minimize it; reads bureaucracy and public mood; risks losing her license for helping illiterate clients. Sends legal jokes to Elowen Pike. She becomes a public organizer if protected from retaliatory paperwork.",
